itle":"Completion and consequences","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:6195a0bdcd4f774dbf24c0ef4be8a05715a9c940c8fd0937bc828cd15bd4db78","file":"preprints/Homogeneous-depth-five-lower-bounds-for-iterated-matrix-multiplication-September-25-2026/build/sections/06-completion.tex","line":69,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"bd572b65b9d1b3c3d578b6ff54204aa1d1ec4d540b45ec9e9a94e62a05c6584e","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Homogeneous-depth-five-lower-bounds-for-iterated-matrix-multiplication-September-25-2026/build/sections/06-completion.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:6195a0bdcd4f774dbf24c0ef4be8a05715a9c940c8fd0937bc828cd15bd4db78","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Homogeneous-depth-five-lower-bounds-for-iterated-matrix-multiplication-September-25-2026/build/sections/06-completion.tex#L69"},"statement_kind":"proposition","text":"\\label{prop:upper}\nLet $K$ be any field and $n\\ge2$.  Put\n\\[\n t=\\lceil\\sqrt n\\rceil,\n \\qquad r=\\left\\lceil\\frac nt\\right\\rceil.\n\\]\nThere is a syntactically homogeneous\n$\\Sigma\\Pi\\Sigma\\Pi\\Sigma$ circuit over $K$ computing $\\IMM_{n,n}$\nwhose number of gates, including leaves, is at most\n\\begin{equation}\n\\label{eq:upper-gate-bound}\n 2n^3+rn^2+rn^{t+1}+n^{r-1}+1\n \\le n^{\\sqrt n+4}.\n\\end{equation}"}
